{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:02:54.420Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Hei, olen Hieronta Maatti. Millä nimellä kutsumme teidät hierontaan?", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:03:03.491Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Jukka roh.", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:03:04.848Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:03:09.121Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä organisaatio tai yritys Teitä edustaa, ja jos haluatte, voitte samalla kertoa jonkin mukavan muiston näiltä tai aiemmilta ATK-päiviltä?", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:03:20.697Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Parha.", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:03:21.636Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T08:03:26.099Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä on Teille mukava muisto näiltä tai aiemmilta ATK-päiviltä?", "call_sid": "CAdc9a465991da24e7f1ec1c2545f29a1d", "stream_sid": "MZ4f1cc05000b09def889a4b494cc7bcca", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
